+/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
+/* decContextGetStatus -- return current status                       */
+/*                                                                    */
+/*  context is the context structure to be queried                    */
+/*  returns status                                                    */
+/*                                                                    */
+/* No error is possible.                                              */
+/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
